  "admissionBlocker": {
    "requiredHumanDecision": "Approve a closed, versioned Synapse execution scope with adapter/pool/action bindings and child capability/pause checks before implementing it. No current DefiExecutionScope variant interprets Synapse SwapQuery/SynapseParams.",
    "evidence": [
      "SynapseRouter._adapterSwap pulls caller token to query.swapAdapter then invokes ISwapAdapter(query.swapAdapter).adapterSwap with query.rawParams and msg.value.",
      "SynapseAdapter.adapterSwap ABI-decodes rawParams, approves caller-selected params.pool without an exact reviewed target binding, and dispatches swap/addLiquidity/removeLiquidityOneToken. Its inner calls use zero minimum and MAX_UINT deadline, relying on an outer adapter caller for constraints.",
      "SynapseRouter.bridge may call that same arbitrary origin adapter and additionally interprets destination action bytes. API/quote-generated calldata is not trusted authorization."
    ],
    "unchangedControls": "No catalog capability, API-key grant, frontend listing or execution-language change. KyberSwap and Alpaca remain independently skipped."
  }
